{
  "page": 588,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5855,
      "text": "Sekali-kali jangan begitu! Sesungguhnya catatan orang yang durhaka benar-benar tersimpan dalam Sijjīn.[900]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5856,
      "text": "Dan tahukah engkau apakah Sijjīn itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5857,
      "text": "(Yaitu) Kitab yang berisi catatan (amal).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5858,
      "text": "Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi orang-orang yang mendustakan!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5859,
      "text": "(yaitu) orang-orang yang mendustakannya (hari pembalasan).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5860,
      "text": "Dan tidak ada yang mendustakannya (hari pembalasan) kecuali setiap orang yang melampaui batas dan berdosa,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5861,
      "text": "yang apabila dibacakan kepadanya ayat-ayat Kami, dia berkata, \"Itu adalah dongeng orang-orang dahulu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5862,
      "text": "Sekali-kali tidak! Bahkan apa yang mereka kerjakan itu telah menutupi hati mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5863,
      "text": "Sekali-kali tidak![901] Sesungguhnya mereka pada hari itu benar-benar terhalang dari (melihat) Tuhannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5864,
      "text": "Kemudian, sesungguhnya mereka benar-benar masuk neraka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5865,
      "text": "Kemudian, dikatakan (kepada mereka), \"Inilah (azab) yang dahulu kamu dustakan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5866,
      "text": "Sekali-kali tidak! Sesungguhnya catatan orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar tersimpan dalam 'Illiyyīn.[902]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5867,
      "text": "Dan tahukah engkau apakah 'Illiyyīn itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5868,
      "text": "(Yaitu) Kitab yang berisi catatan (amal),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5869,
      "text": "yang disaksikan oleh (malaikat-malaikat) yang didekatkan (kepada Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5870,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar berada dalam (surga yang penuh) kenikmatan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5871,
      "text": "mereka (duduk) di atas dipan-dipan melepas pandangan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5872,
      "text": "Kamu dapat mengetahui dari wajah mereka kesenangan hidup yang penuh kenikmatan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5873,
      "text": "Mereka diberi minum dari khamar murni (tidak memabukkan) yang (tempatnya) masih dilak (disegel).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5874,
      "text": "Laknya dari kasturi. Dan untuk yang demikian itu hendaknya orang berlomba-lomba.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5875,
      "text": "Dan campurannya dari tasnīm,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5876,
      "text": "(yaitu) mata air yang diminum oleh mereka yang dekat (kepada Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5877,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berdosa,adalah mereka yang dahulu menertawakan orang-orang yang beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5878,
      "text": "Dan apabila mereka (orang-orang yang beriman) melintas di hadapan mereka, mereka saling mengedip-ngedipkan matanya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5879,
      "text": "dan apabila kembali kepada kaumnya, mereka kembali dengan gembira ria.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5880,
      "text": "Dan apabila mereka melihat (orang-orang mukmin), mereka mengatakan, \"Sesungguhnya mereka benar-benar orang-orang sesat,\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5881,
      "text": "padahal (orang-orang yang berdosa itu), mereka tidak diutus sebagai penjaga (orang-orang mukmin).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5882,
      "text": "Maka pada hari ini, orang-orang yang beriman yang menertawakan orang-orang kafir,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 588,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
